      "summaries": {
        "en": "The ai-data-science-team project is an AI-powered multi-agent system that automates routine data science workflows, addressing the time-consuming nature of tasks like data cleaning and model selection. It employs specialized AI agents that collaborate through a structured workflow, with each agent handling specific steps such as data preprocessing or model training. Users can deploy it via Python to accelerate exploratory data analysis or prototyping, and customize the agent pipeline for tailored automation in their projects.",
        "zh": "ai-data-science-team 是一个基于多智能体协作的AI项目，旨在自动化数据科学中的常规任务，如数据清洗和模型选择，以提升工作效率。其核心设计采用分工明确的AI代理，通过协同工作流处理数据预处理、特征工程等环节，体现了模块化智能体在复杂任务中的优势。实践上，用户可通过Python快速部署进行探索性数据分析或原型开发，并可调整代理配置以适应特定需求，为数据科学工作流提供灵活高效的自动化支持。",
        "es": "The ai-data-science-team project is an AI-powered multi-agent system that automates routine data science workflows, addressing the time-consuming nature of tasks like data cleaning and model selection. It employs specialized AI agents that collaborate through a structured workflow, with each agent handling specific steps such as data preprocessing or model training. Users can deploy it via Python to accelerate exploratory data analysis or prototyping, and customize the agent pipeline for tailored automation in their projects.",
        "sections": {
