          "what": "The ai-data-science-team project is an AI-powered multi-agent system that automates routine data science workflows, addressing the time-consuming nature of tasks like data cleaning and model selection. It employs specialized AI agents that collaborate through a structured workflow, with each agent handling specific steps such as data preprocessing or model training. Users can deploy it via Python to accelerate exploratory data analysis or prototyping, and customize the agent pipeline for tailored automation in their projects.",
